                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower. Light winds. Overnight temperatures falling to around 4 with daytime temperatures reaching around 19.</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 10:40am to 1:50pm, UV Index predicted to reach 3 [Moderate]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-08-07T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-08T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-06T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-07T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Patches of frost in the west in the early morning. The chance of morning fog. Slight chance of a shower at night. Light winds becoming northerly 15 to 20 km/h in the middle of the day. Overnight temperatures falling to around 2 with daytime temperatures reaching the low 20s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-08-08T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-09T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-07T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-08T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Very high chance of showers. Winds northerly 15 to 25 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to around 8 with daytime temperatures reaching around 16.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-08-09T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-10T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-08T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-09T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Very high chance of rain, most likely in the morning and afternoon. Winds northerly 20 to 30 km/h turning westerly 25 to 35 km/h during the afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to around 8 with daytime temperatures reaching around 16.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
